 "text": "Hey, nice to hear from you. How are you? They' attracted to sweet things, so don't leave anything out. Keep your food in sealed containers and don't leave cups by the floor. Jam wattles are popular, but bees build them too. A big stone or flat rock works and looks way cooler. Not for the real thing. It' for yellow card cards only. A real wasp nest is made of paper, often from inside your house. Then leave area and call the authorities. They' trained to handle it without getting stung.",
